      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A model is presented to generate power spectrum noise with intensity proportional to 1/f\u2009 as a function of frequency f. The model arises from a broken-symmetry variable, which corresponds to absolute pitch, where fluctuations occur in an attempt to restore that symmetry, influenced by interactions in the creation of musical melodies."},
